-lasting reliability for technicians and DIYers alike.<p></p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li>3-in-1 Functionality – Crimps, strips, and cuts cables, streamlining cable preparation.</li><li>Supports Multiple Connectors – Compatible with RJ-45 (8P8C), RJ-12 (6P6C), and RJ-11 (6P4C) modular plugs.</li><li>Precision Crimping – Ensures secure and accurate termination for reliable network performance.</li><li>Ergonomic Design – Non-slip, soft-grip handles reduce hand fatigue for extended use.</li><li>Durable Construction – Built from hardened steel for strength and long-term use.</li><li>Safety Lock Mechanism – Built-in latch keeps the tool safely closed when not in use.</li></ul><p><br></p>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"INGCO HMPCN2468R Modular Plug Crimper","href":"/ingco-hmpcn2468r-modular-plug-crimper","now":"750৳","old":"850৳","single":""},{"name":"INGCO HMPC1468P Modular Plug Crimper","href":"/ingco-hmpc1468p-modular-plug-crimper","now":"900৳","old":"950৳","single":""},{"name":"XPIA RJ45 RJ11/12 CAT5 CAT5e CAT6 Pass Through Connector Crimping Tool","href":"/xpia-rj45-rj1112-cat5-cat5e-cat6-pass-through-connector-crimping-tool","now":"1,300৳","old":"1,500৳","single":""},{"name":"298 N7088 Modular Crimping Tool","href":"/298-n7088-modular-crimping-tool","now":"","old":"","single":"1,150৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":{"title":"From Same Brand","items":[{"href":"/trendnet-tc-nt2-network-cable-tester","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/TRENDnet/TC-NT2/TC-NT2-500x500-2-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"TRENDnet TC-NT2 Network Cable Tester","width":100,"height":100},"name":"TRENDnet TC-NT2 Network Cable Tester","now":"6,100৳","old":"6,500৳","single":"","tax":"Ex Tax:6,100৳","out":false},{"href":"/t